* LT6106 high-side current-sense amplifier, 100mA through 0.1 ohm shunt
.include LT6106.sub

VRAIL RAIL 0 DC 12
RSHUNT RAIL IN 0.1
ILOAD IN 0 DC 100m

* Gain = ROUT/RIN = 10k/100 = 100V/V
RIN IN NINM 100
ROUT OUT 0 10k

* Pin order: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT
XU1 RAIL NINM RAIL 0 OUT LT6106

.tran 0 10m 0 10u
.meas tran vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 9m TO 10m

.end
